    wp_ch6_s2_p2: "NEO adopts fixed total issuance without unlimited minting, ensuring long-term value scarcity support. All outputs are distributed to real participants through mining, node contributions, and ecological incentives, avoiding value monopoly caused by pre-mining and concentrated holdings.",
